  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中文思辨與表達(一)",
    "sub_ename": "CRITICAL THINKING AND EXPRESSION IN CHINESE(1)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以中文之閱讀理解、敘述表達能力之培養為目標，在執行面，以古今、中外之經典為依歸，從經典啟發思考，向經典學習表達，從而導向現代的詮釋與應用，將人文素養的薰陶，融入語文表達的鍛鍊，落實於社會應用。",
    "describe_eh": "1.The university’s Chinese language curriculum corresponds to the university’s \"Communication ability\" and \"Teamwork\" ability rubrics. \n2.\"Communication ability\": Narration is the primary objective of the training. In terms of formal expression, it is divided into two parts: text and oral. A particular theme is chosen to focus on outcome-based learning. On the spiritual side of the content, the course emphasizes multiple thinking on issues using constructions and reflections. \n3.\"Teamwork\": Comprehensive teams are grouped based on the principle of inter-college and inter-department emphasizing multi-field cooperation so that they can complete the specific projects.\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "正確並深刻理解閱讀內容。",
      "describe_en": " "
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備書寫表達與口語溝通的能力。",
      "describe_en": " "
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "認識自我，建立多元的價值觀。",
      "describe_en": null
    }
